Design Philosophy

I don't approach AI as a chatbot-first problem.

I start with the business process:

Business Problem
       ↓
Process Analysis
       ↓
AI Opportunity
       ↓
Business Value + Feasibility + Risk
       ↓
TO-BE Process
       ↓
AI Architecture
       ↓
Automation
       ↓
Evaluation & Monitoring

The goal is not simply to add AI.

The goal is to design a solution that is useful, implementable, measurable and controllable.

